            "image_link": "https://www.huntingwithsoldiers.org/",
            "title": "<p><strong>Hunting with Soldiers</strong><br/>Non-Profit | Outdoor Healing & PTSD Support | Texas</p>",
            "text": "<p>Based out of Paducah, TX, Hunting with Soldiers uses the outdoors as a vehicle for healing — organizing hunts and fishing trips that bring veterans together and provide real PTSD support through nature and brotherhood.</p>",
            "button_text": "Learn More",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_text_2": "Learn More"
