            "image_link": "https://www.theoutreach-project.com/",
            "title": "<p><strong>The Outreach Project</strong><br/>Veteran Resource Podcast | Las Vegas & San Antonio</p>",
            "text": "<p>Josh Melching and Jonathan Hodge run one of the most authentic veteran-focused podcasts out there — connecting people to resources, stories, and community. A trusted voice in the veteran space and a natural fit for the Iron Soldiers Coffee Company network.</p>",
